d":"cutover-04"},"rationale":"Fresh cutover inspection has no mandatory gaps. The revision now persists graceful, broker-denied or unknown classification, requires correlated positive evidence for the first two, treats unavailable proof as unknown, requires crash-consistent release qualification for nongraceful reopening and reports classification to the user. Proposed qualification includes clean-drain and regression predecessors.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:113,147–150,182–187","src/daemon/legacy-daemon-cutover.ts: drainLegacyDaemonForCutover","src/daemon/shutdown.ts: failClosed and drain completion",".insrc/tmp/design-review/macos-installer-migration-5d5478c6.json: attempt 2 completedChunks/cutover"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["cutover"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"visuals","findingId":"visuals-01"},"rationale":"The revised generated sequence still expresses mutually exclusive running, stopped, success and rollback routes as one linear sequence. Accepted visuals-03 confirms the continuing concern, and actual rendering remains unverified. Carry this origin.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-5d5478c61a25ac8f-s1.json: /body/sequenceDefinition/messages","docs/standalone/enable-managed-daemon-lifecycle-macos-install-E202611115d5478c6/S001/sequence-diagram.html: embedded sequenceDiagram",".insrc/tmp/design-review/macos-installer-migration-5d5478c6.json: attempt 2 completedChunks/visuals"],"action":"carry"},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"visuals","findingId":"visuals-02"},"rationale":"The live hyperlink still repeats the repository-relative directory and resolves to a nonexistent document-relative target. The canonical companion exists. Accepted visuals-04 confirms this unchanged defect; no resolution is claimed.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:133",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-5d5478c61a25ac8f-s1.json: /body/companions/0/relPath",".insrc/tmp/design-review/macos-installer-migration-5d5478c6.json: attempt 2 completedChunks/visuals/findings/